# qa-record.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Q&A process record, decision-table style
- Recorded per round, persisted every 2-3 rounds
- Factual, no subjective evaluation

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Q&A record

### H2 (required)
- Q&A table: # / question / answer / understanding strength
- Decision table: ID / decision / basis / status / source

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Undefined items table: item / disposition
- [optional] Scenario assumptions table: assumption / confirmation
